---
 const personalImageAlt = "Benjamín Quezada"
---

<article class="flex flex-col items-center justify-center gap-10 md:flex-row">
  <div class="flex-1 rounded-2xl bg-white/60 dark:bg-white/[0.03] border border-gray-200/80 dark:border-white/[0.06] shadow-sm dark:shadow-none p-6 order-2 md:order-1">
    <div class="[&>p]:mb-4 [&>p]:text-sm [&>p]:leading-relaxed [&>p>strong]:text-violet-600 dark:[&>p>strong]:text-violet-300 [&>p>strong]:font-semibold text-gray-700 dark:text-gray-300">
      <p>
        Mi nombre es Benjamín Quezada, <strong>Ingeniero en Informática</strong> egresado de la Universidad Andrés Bello.
      </p>
      <p>
        Algunas de mis habilidades incluyen: <strong>trabajo en equipo y manejo de tecnologías como NestJS, TypeScript, React, C, C++, MongoDB y VMware.</strong>
      </p>
      <p class="!mb-0">
        Certificaciones: <strong>Artificial Intelligence Practitioner Certificate y TOEIC Bridge.</strong>
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="order-1 md:order-2 flex-shrink-0">
    <div class="relative">
      <div class="absolute inset-0 rounded-2xl bg-gradient-to-br from-violet-400/30 to-blue-400/30 dark:from-violet-500/20 dark:to-blue-500/20 blur-xl scale-105"></div>
      <img
        width="200"
        height="200"
        src="/yo.jfif"
        alt={personalImageAlt}
        class="relative w-48 h-48 lg:w-56 lg:h-56 object-cover rounded-2xl rotate-2 ring-1 ring-black/10 dark:ring-white/10 shadow-lg"
        style="object-position: 50% 50%"
      />
    </div>
  </div>
</article>
